  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_4840.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Club Pilotari Onda ha clausurado este fin de semana la temporada con la entrega de trofeos de las diferentes cpompeticiones, adem&aacute;s de la disputa de la final del campeonato local d&#39;Escala i Corda, en la que Pedro L&oacute;pez y Carlos Guinot se han impuesto a Jordi Serrano, Vicente Varea y Antonio G&oacute;mez por 60-40.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4579.jpg\" alt=\"img_4579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4580.jpg\" alt=\"img_4580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4581.jpg\" alt=\"img_4581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4582.jpg\" alt=\"img_4582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4583.jpg\" alt=\"img_4583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4584.jpg\" alt=\"img_4584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4585.jpg\" alt=\"img_4585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4586.jpg\" alt=\"img_4586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaltemporada13pilota/img_4587.jpg\" alt=\"img_4587\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig